{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102537","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102537/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102537/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102537/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102537","id":2838527226,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6pMHz6","number":102537,"title":"Timer shouldn't automatically disable its autostart property","user":{"login":"crapola","id":854580,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDU4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854580?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crapola","html_url":"https://github.com/crapola","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crapola/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crapola/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crapola/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crapola/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crapola/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crapola/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crapola/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crapola/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crapola/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","color":"b64245","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-02-07T16:06:12Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T15:25:01Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.beta1.official [d33da79d3]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1 - Windows 11 (build 22631)\n\n### Issue description\n\nTimer nodes set `autostart=false` after entering the scene tree. Perhaps there is a good reason for it, but this caught me off guard when I was duplicating nodes.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nExample code:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar t1:=Timer.new()\n\tt1.autostart=true\n\tt1.timeout.connect(func1)\n\tadd_child(t1)\n\tvar t2:=t1.duplicate()\n\tt2.timeout.connect(func2)\n\tadd_child(t2)\n\t#t2.start()\n\nfunc func1()->void:\n\tprint(\"a\")\n\nfunc func2()->void:\n\tprint(\"b\")\n```\n\nIn this case I expected the second Timer to start automatically as i didn't have a reason to think it would change its property. \nI did notice later that autostart's documentation mentions it, it's just not intuitive.\nI know the example looks contrived but you have to imagine the Timer node as being part of a duplicated branch.\nThe solution I found for my use case was to connect the Timer's tree_entered to its own start.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102537/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102537/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}